            {
              "h": "have / has",
              "body": "I/you/we/they <code>have</code><br>he/she/it <code>has</code><br><span class=\"es\">She <b>has</b> a dog. I <b>have</b> two brothers.</span>"
            },
            {
              "h": "negativo / pregunta",
              "body": "I <code>don't have</code> · she <code>doesn't have</code><br><code>Do</code> you have…? · <code>Does</code> he have…?"
            },
            {
              "h": "posesivos",
              "body": "I→<b>my</b> · you→<b>your</b> · he→<b>his</b><br>she→<b>her</b> · we→<b>our</b> · they→<b>their</b>"
            },
            {
              "h": "ejemplo",
              "body": "<span class=\"ok\">This is my sister.</span><br><span class=\"ok\">His name is Tom.</span> · <span class=\"ok\">Her job is nice.</span>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "stretch",
          "h": "A2 · EXTRA",
          "body": "Posesivo con <b>'s</b>: \"Ana<b>'s</b> brother is a doctor.\" · Plurales: brother → brother<b>s</b>, child → child<b>ren</b>, person → people."
        }
